  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Empowerment for Kenya&apos;s Slum Adolescents</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will pay tuition fee for 50 needy and vulnerable slum adolescent girls transitioning to high school in 2024, and set up an equipped Community Learning Centre in Kibera slum providing opportunity for technical skills training and knowledge acquisition to 100 vulnerable and disadvantaged teen mothers from Kenya&apos;s informal settings. The centre will provide child support space for the babies of the teen mothers who can not afford to pay for childcare nor have no one to leave the baby.</narrative>
  </description>
